### Get all trips
GET http://localhost:5000/trips

### Get trips filtered by line
GET http://localhost:5000/trips?lineId=1

### Get trips filtered by date range
GET http://localhost:5000/trips?from=2026-03-27T00:00:00&to=2026-03-28T00:00:00

### Process trip updates - Late
POST http://localhost:5000/updates/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    {
      "tripId": 1,
      "actualDeparture": "2026-03-27T08:10:00",
      "actualArrival": "2026-03-27T09:10:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Process trip updates - Early
POST http://localhost:5000/updates/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    {
      "tripId": 2,
      "actualDeparture": "2026-03-27T09:50:00",
      "actualArrival": "2026-03-27T10:50:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Process trip updates - Invalid trip
POST http://localhost:5000/updates/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updates": [
    {
      "tripId": 999,
      "actualDeparture": "2026-03-27T08:00:00",
      "actualArrival": "2026-03-27T09:00:00"
    }
  ]
}

### Get all update logs
GET http://localhost:5000/updatelogs

### Get update logs filtered by status
GET http://localhost:5000/updatelogs?status=Late
